Learning games for toddlers can help your little one learn through engaging sorting and matching activities. These games will immerse your child in the world of Bimi Boo and his friends, who live on an island and engage in various educational activities. Your child will play toddler games featuring various animals, including dogs, kittens, monkeys, birds, rabbits, and squirrels.
This learning game for kids provides an opportunity to spend time effectively and safely on an electronic device. The toddler app features simple games designed to develop fine motor skills, logic, memory, and entertain your child with bright colors, cute characters, and engaging tasks.
The toddler app includes the following educational games:
- Sorting items by color, shape, quantity, and size;
- Classifying objects using logic;
- Matching geometric shapes by silhouette;
- Sorting figures in the correct order;
- Reconstructing pictures from memory.
Designed for preschool kids, namely suitable for both boys and girls aged 2-5 years. All activities are developed with the participation of professionals in the field of children’s education and include educational elements such as puzzles, sorting, and logic games.
Encourage your toddler to explore, learn, and grow with Bimi Boo and friends by enjoying fun games. Let’s embark on this journey together, where all 30 learning games are available to play offline. Get started now and try out 3 toddler games for free!

